			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2679394">
									

<p>As someone who, fortunately, never had an opportunity to neglect a tamagotchi and then feel bad for it, this still freaks me out in all the right ways. It's fucking zombie tamagotchis, and it punishes you by 1) eating all your important files, and 2) making your devices smell like fricking animal dung. Where this piece loses me is where it violently dismembers and eats a researcher. I'm following the fact that it's meant to be implied that a <em>lot</em> more is going on than what's said at the surface, but the fact that it eats a researcher seems to come out of left field.</p>
<p>I wanna like it, for WTF-ness alone, but it's not jiving right now, and I don't know why, and that's bugging me.</p>

